## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design OTCA-compliant governance for feature flags and telemetry with strict residency, immutable records, and secure audit trails.

## Key Concepts

- OTCA residency enforcement
- Write-once ledger (Iceberg/Parquet)
- Region-scoped streaming (Kafka topics)
- Privacy masking for telemetry
- Rollback and rollout testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: region-local validation and masking
function processEvent(event){
  // enforce residency
  if (!inRegion(event.region)) throw new Error("region mismatch");
  // apply masking for sensitive fields
  event.user_id = hash(event.user_id);
  return event;
}
```

